// Each question is { q: question, a: answer, w: one line that teaches, c: wrong answers for answer-choice mode }.
// Any number of questions per array works; the wheel shows up to 8 at a time.
// Text can also be { en: '…', yo: '…' } to offer more languages (a Language picker appears automatically).
// After editing, bump CACHE in sw.js so installed phones pick up the change.
